            "id": 76780,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dilakukan operator kesetaraan, <code>==</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ini memeriksa apakah sebuah string sama dengan string lainnya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini memeriksa apakah sebuah string lebih besar daripada string lainnya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ini memeriksa apakah sebuah string sama dengan string lainnya.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah program memeriksa <code>\"sun\" == \"sunset\"</code>. Apa yang ditanyakan perbandingan itu?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Apakah kedua string sama persis</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Apakah string pertama berada sebelum string kedua</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Apakah string kedua diawali dengan string pertama</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Apakah kedua string sama persis.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 76779,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Manakah dari berikut ini yang merupakan operator kesetaraan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>==</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu ingin memeriksa apakah <code>color</code> menyimpan <code>\"red\"</code>. Operator mana yang digunakan dalam perbandingan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>==</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>!=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 76778,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan di console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;LED+&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;LED&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>False</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>True</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Output yang ditampilkan berasal dari <code>\"LED+\" == \"LED\"</code>.</p><p>Jika kamu mengubah string kanan menjadi <code>\"LED+\"</code>, apa yang akan ditampilkan kode?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;LED+&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;LED&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>False</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"LED+\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 76777,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perbandingan mana yang menghasilkan <code>True</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" == \"orange\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perbandingan dengan <code>==</code> harus menghasilkan <code>True</code>. Manakah yang menghasilkan nilai tersebut?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" == \"orange\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" = \"apple\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 76790,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah <code>my_answer</code> sama dengan <code>solution</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;act&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution  = \" /><text value=\"&quot;ace&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kata <code>\"act\"</code> dan <code>\"ace\"</code> hampir sama, tetapi tidak setara.</p><p>Bandingkan <code>my_answer</code> dengan <code>solution</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;act&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution  = \" /><text value=\"&quot;ace&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 76776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan string <code>\"high\"</code> di <code>my_answer</code> agar perbandingannya menjadi <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"high\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perbandingan hanya menghasilkan <code>False</code> jika kedua string tidak sama.</p><p>Simpan <code>\"high\"</code> dalam <code>my_answer</code> dan bandingkan agar kode menampilkan <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"my_answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"solution = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(my_answer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"high\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
